OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FFrom the Barbican, the Sinfonia of
OL,7,     FLondon and John Wilson are joined
OL,8,     Fby Benjamin Grosvenor for
OL,9,     FRachmaninov's Piano Concerto No 2,
OL,10,     Ffollowed by Rimsky-Korsakov's
OL,11,     FScheherezade.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Peggy Seeger - A Life
OL,13,G     in Music
OL,14,     FIn her twenties, with no training
OL,15,     Fin orchestration, Peggy Seeger
OL,16,     Fscored a radio ballad about
OL,17,     Fboxing. She tells Kate Molleson
OL,18,     Fhow she did it.
